{"id": "EUVD-2026-99248", "enisaUuid": "cc57d4d2-8bf0-329e-9cca-3f40bdcc12e6", "description": "Wukong AICRM through 20260610 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated user to call user, role, department and agent administration APIs because no administrator check exists. Attackers can send POST requests to /managerUser/updateUser to reset the admin account's password and assign themselves the \"all\" role, achieving full administrator account takeover.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T18:49:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:08:57", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/wukong-aicrm-api-wide-missing-authorization", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM/blob/20260610/backend/src/main/java/com/kakarote/ai_crm/service/impl/ManageUserServiceImpl.java#L181-L237", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM/blob/20260610/backend/src/main/java/com/kakarote/ai_crm/config/SecurityConfig.java#L66-L84", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM/blob/20260610/backend/src/main/java/com/kakarote/ai_crm/controller/ManagerUserController.java#L45-L72", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM/blob/20260610/backend/src/main/java/com/kakarote/ai_crm/service/impl/ManagerRoleServiceImpl.java#L224-L243", "https://github.com/WuKongOpenSource/Wukong-AICRM", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wukong-aicrm-through-20260610-missing-authorization-in-user-and-role-management-apis"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110207", "GHSA-qhwv-w4m8-x75g"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.45, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0d5bdea6-a876-34bd-8769-792d27049f44", "product": {"name": "Wukong AICRM", "vendor": {"name": "WuKongOpenSource"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226420260610"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "65692483-cdbe-3838-98ab-020a76ecbbaf", "vendor": {"name": "WuKongOpenSource"}}], "isExploited": f